  "title": {
    "ru": "Сочетания гласных: ee, ea, oo, ai, ou…",
    "en": "Vowel teams: ee, ea, oo, ai, ou…",
    "es": "Grupos de vocales: ee, ea, oo, ai, ou…"
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "en-ee-ea",
      "title": {
        "ru": "ee, ea — долгое [iː]",
        "en": "ee, ea",
        "es": "ee, ea"
      },
      "text": {
        "ru": "ee и ea обычно читаются как долгое «и» [iː]: see, meet, sea, read. У ea есть исключения с [e]: bread, head, weather, и с [eɪ]: great, break.",
        "en": "ee and ea usually give a long [iː]: see, sea. Exceptions with [e]: bread, head; with [eɪ]: great."
      },
      "ipa": "iː",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "see",
          "ru": "видеть"
        },
        {
          "en": "meet",
          "ru": "встречать"
        },
        {
          "en": "sea",
          "ru": "море"
        },
        {
          "en": "bread",
          "ru": "хлеб"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "en-oo",
      "title": {
        "ru": "oo — [uː] или [ʊ]",
        "en": "oo",
        "es": "oo"
      },
      "text": {
        "ru": "oo чаще долгое «у» [uː]: food, moon, school. Перед k и в нескольких частых словах — краткое [ʊ]: book, look, good, foot. Сравните: pool / pull, fool / full.",
        "en": "oo is usually long [uː]: food, moon; short [ʊ] before k and in good, foot: book, look."
      },
      "ipa": "uː / ʊ",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "food",
          "ru": "еда"
        },
        {
          "en": "moon",
          "ru": "луна"
        },
        {
          "en": "book",
          "ru": "книга"
        },
        {
          "en": "good",
          "ru": "хороший"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "en-ai-ay",
      "title": {
        "ru": "ai, ay — [eɪ]",
        "en": "ai, ay",
        "es": "ai, ay"
      },
      "text": {
        "ru": "ai (внутри слова) и ay (в конце) читаются [eɪ] «эй»: rain, wait, day, play. Исключение: said [sed], says [sez].",
        "en": "ai (inside a word) and ay (at the end) give [eɪ]: rain, day. Exception: said [sed]."
      },
      "ipa": "eɪ",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "rain",
          "ru": "дождь"
        },
        {
          "en": "wait",
          "ru": "ждать"
        },
        {
          "en": "day",
          "ru": "день"
        },
        {
          "en": "play",
          "ru": "играть"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "en-oa-ow",
      "title": {
        "ru": "oa, ow — [əʊ] или [aʊ]",
        "en": "oa, ow",
        "es": "oa, ow"
      },
      "text": {
        "ru": "oa — [əʊ] «оу»: boat, road, coat. ow бывает двух видов: [əʊ] в конце многих слов — show, know, window — и [aʊ] «ау» — now, how, town, down. ou тоже чаще [aʊ]: out, house, mouse.",
        "en": "oa = [əʊ]: boat. ow is [əʊ] in show, know or [aʊ] in now, town; ou is usually [aʊ]: out, house."
      },
      "ipa": "əʊ / aʊ",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "boat",
          "ru": "лодка"
        },
        {
          "en": "show",
          "ru": "шоу"
        },
        {
          "en": "now",
          "ru": "сейчас"
        },
        {
          "en": "house",
          "ru": "дом"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "en-oi-oy",
      "title": {
        "ru": "oi, oy — [ɔɪ]; au, aw — [ɔː]",
        "en": "oi, oy; au, aw",
        "es": "oi, oy; au, aw"
      },
      "text": {
        "ru": "oi (внутри) и oy (в конце) — [ɔɪ] «ой»: coin, boy, enjoy. au и aw — долгое [ɔː]: August, author, saw, draw.",
        "en": "oi, oy = [ɔɪ]: coin, boy. au, aw = [ɔː]: August, saw."
      },
      "ipa": "ɔɪ / ɔː",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "coin",
          "ru": "монета"
        },
        {
          "en": "boy",
          "ru": "мальчик"
        },
        {
          "en": "saw",
          "ru": "видел"
        },
        {
          "en": "August",
          "ru": "август"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "en-igh",
      "title": {
        "ru": "igh — [aɪ]",
        "en": "igh",
        "es": "igh"
      },
      "text": {
        "ru": "В сочетании igh буквы gh немые, а i читается [aɪ] «ай»: night, light, high, right. Тот же звук в eigh даёт [eɪ]: eight, weight.",
        "en": "In igh the gh is silent and i is [aɪ]: night, light. eigh gives [eɪ]: eight."
      },
      "ipa": "aɪ",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "night",
          "ru": "ночь"
        },
        {
          "en": "light",
          "ru": "свет"
        },
        {
          "en": "right",
          "ru": "правый"
        },
        {
          "en": "eight",
          "ru": "восемь"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
